This is a multi-tenant Laravel SaaS project.

Tenant isolation rules:

- Always respect mandant_id.
- Never query tenant-owned data without tenant scope.
- Never expose data from one tenant to another tenant.
- Controllers must only access records owned by the authenticated tenant.
- Services must preserve tenant context.
- Jobs must receive and use the correct tenant or mandant context.
- Tests should cover tenant isolation for important features.
- Avoid using Model::all() on tenant-owned models.
